            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remedy, a recent graduate from the Saturnian healing school, must descend to Hurtland and use her powers to heal everyone from stray ducks to dark lords, and finally cure the ailing Prince Hingst. It's a short, whimsical adventure with plenty of heart(s).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was one of Ludosity's entries in the Games Against Ebola charity game jam in 2014. This version was made after the jam to include options, multiple savefiles, more difficulty levels, and gamepad support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel Princess Remedy in a Heap of Trouble was released in 2016, also available on Steam.</p>",
